+# Lore test descriptors
+
+| Field  | Value       |
+| ------ | ----------- |
+| Status | Implemented |
+
+Lore test descriptors connect listed tests to the specification statements they validate.
+
+- When a test file contains one distinct spec anchor stamp, the test list includes that anchor as the `spec` field of its descriptors ([validated by: includes the stamped spec anchor in a test descriptor](../../scripts/lore-list-tests.test.ts#L4)).
+
+- When a file contains multiple spec anchor stamps, each test descriptor uses the stamp immediately preceding its declaration ([validated by: associates each test with its own preceding stamp](../../scripts/lore-multiple-anchors.test.ts#L4)).
